epeatedly labeled `SAMPLE_RULE` / “僅為示範規則，非本會或官方標準.” No numerical conclusion is presented as an official threshold or as a career-fit claim.\n8. **Actual DOCX readability / rendered layout** — PASS. Rendered PDF is 21 pages; independent PDF-text extraction confirms readable tables and the corrected p.19 rows. `visual_review_R07.json` records `layout_result=PASS` with no clipping/overlap/broken borders on changed pages; unchanged pages are hash-identical to inspected prior renders. Header/footer consistently carry identity and `SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC | CANDIDATE ONLY | REAL=UNKNOWN/HOLD`.\n\n### 5. Formal acceptance\n`formal_acceptance=NOT_GRANTED`. The document is a candidate/sample artifact only; no real evidence, consultation, consent, approval, or official acceptance is claimed. Checkbox 084 remains `PARTIAL/HOLD` pending the four distinct products (0076/0077/0078/0079) and real source paths.","time":{"start":1792380104887,"end":1792380107883}}}
